{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826710/extras/Build_your_team_and_fights.png?t=1743727843\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assemble your dream team by befriending a variety of unique Creatures to fight alongside you in real time. Choose your Creatures wisely to best handle any challenge that stands in your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826710/extras/1.gif?t=1743727843\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826710/extras/Customize_your_creatures.png?t=1743727843\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create powerful, diverse, and stylish playstyles through gameplay-altering skill gems, perks, weapons and more while looking the part with tons of hats to dress your Creatures up in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826710/extras/2.gif?t=1743727843\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826710/extras/potent_plant_power.png?t=1743727843\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your Pocket Garden to grow food and create helpful Connection Bonuses for your Creatures in an engaging organization mini-game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826710/extras/3.gif?t=1743727843\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826710/extras/knowledge_is_strength.png?t=1743727843\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fill out your Bestiary on the fifty unique Creatures in Thera to unlock powerful buffs and items for your party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826710/extras/4.gif?t=1743727843\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826710/extras/An_epic_journey_awaits.png?t=1743727843\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the vast world of Thera and all its secrets as you take on your quest of destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826710/extras/5.gif?t=1743727843\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1826710?t=1743727843","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1826710?t=1743727843","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826710/58beeb7c19e5c229437f542c1207305a30ae2555/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743727843","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1826710/58beeb7c19e5c229437f542c1207305a30ae2555/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743727843","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN OUR DIS